  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>100</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>99</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>50</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>99</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>50</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />On solving, we get,&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>149</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>99</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>74</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
